# Wave W17-N (Scorch Path): scorch floor — warm tiled through-road flags of the mountain’s own road, ember-brown stone with its joints sunk dark, and the design’s glowing fissures drawn as sparse fissure-lit flecks in the floor’s own art (art layer only — the shipped lavaglow cells stand byte-preserved beside it). The Scorch’s own floor — warm flags, split from Gloom Deep’s near-black earth by value (lit, not dark) and from Copperbore’s tidy cool bore flags by hue (ember-warm, not chalk-cool).
